{"branch":"치평점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">치평점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-d2a9e114d02118c0.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"치평점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-d2a9e114d02118c0.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>전남광주통합특별시 서구 치평로 76 대한빌딩 4층 403호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">광주 1호선</span><span>상무역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>운천초교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>한국수자원공사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>상무한국아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>한국수자원공사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>한국국토정보공사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>계수초교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>한국국토정보공사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>계수초교</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>매월16</span><span>일곡38</span><span>금호46</span><span>선운14</span><span>운림50</span><span>지원25</span><span>첨단22</span><span>지원45</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">지선</span></dt><dd><span>518</span><span>상무62(시청경유상무역행)</span><span>상무64</span><span>상무62(상무역경유시청행)</span><span>상무63</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">급행간선</span></dt><dd><span>좌석02</span><span>순환01